{
  "slug": "agent-smith",
  "name": "Agent Smith",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Agent Smith adds two slash commands to Claude Code: /analyze-agent performs a full configuration audit across 7 evaluation pillars (Security, Instruction Clarity, Configuration Quality, Context Efficiency, Command Design, Hook Safety, MCP Integration), scores each area, identifies issues by severity, and walks you through an interactive fix workflow. /create-agent scaffolds a new configuration with security deny rules and best practices. The tool is honest about its scope — it only measures user-configurable components and clearly states what's outside its reach.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 commands**, `analyze-agent` ([Agent Smith] Full Configuration Analysis), `create-agent` ([Agent Smith] Create Configuration).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agent-smith@claude-community` from `maxencemeloni/claude-code-agent-smith`.\n\nAgent Smith analyzes, validates, and fixes your Claude Code configuration in one interactive workflow:",
